== Second round ==
Starting on 12 January 2012, [[Institut français d'opinion publique|Ifop]]-Fiducial published a "rolling" poll for ''[[Paris Match]]'' and [[Europe 1]] which is listed in the tables below as "Ifop-Fiducial" without an asterisk, while separate polls not conducted as part of the "rolling" poll are listed with an asterisk (*).<ref name="rolling"/> Polls conducted specifically for subsample data are listed with two asterisks (**).

The publication of second-round polls was prohibited after midnight on 4 May 2012.<ref name="silence"/>

